      "f-collapsible-tab-1758137935lgrQK-content_html": "<p>Upgrading your kitchen be simple and feel amazing. That’s why every Perfect Match kit is designed for fast, frustration-free DIY installation.<br /><br /><strong>How It Works:</strong><br /><br /><strong>1) Unbox &amp; Prep</strong> – Everything you need comes in the box. Grab a screwdriver and drill for a quick install.</p>\n<p><br /><strong>2) Set Up Fixtures<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"> </span></strong>– Mount your matching main faucet, RO faucet, and soap dispenser with included hardware.</p>\n<p><br /><strong>3) Quick Connections </strong>– Attach the 4-stage RO system with Twist-Lock filters and pre-fitted lines.</p>\n<p><br /><strong>4) Finish &amp; Enjoy </strong>– From unboxing to fully upgraded sink — pure water, matching fixtures, and modern style in less than half an hour.</p>",
      "f-collapsible-tab-1758137935lgrQK-heading_html": "Installation",
      "f-heading-17581379355JJ0M-text_html": "From Mismatched Mess to a Perfect Match.",
      "f-richtext-17581379358eiG6-text_html": "<p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0px;\">Your sink shouldn’t look like an afterthought. See the difference a fully coordinated fixture + filtration kit makes sleek, seamless, and designed to feel intentional.</span>e.</p>",
      "f-heading-175813793514bOP-text_html": "Seamless Aesthetic",
      "f-richtext-17581379351tgNk-text_html": "<p>Matching finishes create a designer look instantly</p>",
      "f-heading-1758137935IV8dV-text_html": "Modern Quick Twist Filters",
      "f-richtext-17581379355T9Pd-text_html": "<p>Sleek design and effortless replacement for fresh, filtered water.</p>",
      "f-heading-1758137935zOqRS-text_html": "DYI Friendly ",
      "f-richtext-1758137935N7c4C-text_html": "<p>Complete install in under 30 minutes, no plumber required</p>",
      "f-heading-1758137935GT68G-text_html": "Metpure Reverse Osmosis Faucet <br>Product Specifications",
      "f-richtext-1758137935UmJmo-text_html": "<p>A sleek, compact design, the RO Faucet delivers fresh, filtered water on demand. Built for durability and style, it installs easily and pairs perfectly with your kitchen fixtures.</p>",
      "f-heading-1758137935HnChA-text_html": "Customers love us",
      "f-testimonial-items-1758137935V9EE4-testimonial_list-Item-1-bio_html": "Customer",
      "f-testimonial-items-1758137935V9EE4-testimonial_list-Item-1-text_html": "<p>We're humans too and we understand that skin care and cosmetics should rejuvenate and rehydrate in the short and long run.</p>",
      "f-testimonial-items-1758137935V9EE4-testimonial_list-Item-1-author_html": "Felicity Smoke",
      "f-testimonial-items-1758137935V9EE4-testimonial_list-Item-5-bio_html": "Customer",
      "f-testimonial-items-1758137935V9EE4-testimonial_list-Item-5-text_html": "<p>We're humans too and we understand that skin care and cosmetics should rejuvenate and rehydrate in the short and long run.</p>",
      "f-testimonial-items-1758137935V9EE4-testimonial_list-Item-5-author_html": "Felicity Smoke",
      "f-testimonial-items-1758137935V9EE4-testimonial_list-Item-4-bio_html": "Customer",
      "f-testimonial-items-1758137935V9EE4-testimonial_list-Item-4-text_html": "<p>We're humans too and we understand that skin care and cosmetics should rejuvenate and rehydrate in the short and long run.</p>",
      "f-testimonial-items-1758137935V9EE4-testimonial_list-Item-4-author_html": "Felicity Smoke",
      "f-testimonial-items-1758137935V9EE4-testimonial_list-Item-3-bio_html": "Customer",
      "f-testimonial-items-1758137935V9EE4-testimonial_list-Item-3-text_html": "<p>We're humans too and we understand that skin care and cosmetics should rejuvenate and rehydrate in the short and long run.</p>",
      "f-testimonial-items-1758137935V9EE4-testimonial_list-Item-3-author_html": "Felicity Smoke",
      "f-testimonial-items-1758137935V9EE4-testimonial_list-Item-2-bio_html": "Customer",
      "f-testimonial-items-1758137935V9EE4-testimonial_list-Item-2-text_html": "<p>We're humans too and we understand that skin care and cosmetics should rejuvenate and rehydrate in the short and long run.</p>",
      "f-testimonial-items-1758137935V9EE4-testimonial_list-Item-2-author_html": "Felicity Smoke",
      "f-heading-1758137935Ttgbe-text_html": "Why wait?  Order yours now.",
      "f-richtext-1758137935jAakE-text_html": "<p>Two straps in refreshing colors! Three microphones at work simultaneously for a clearer call experience.</p>",
      "f-add-to-cart-button-1758137935jHOtw-button_label_html": "Order now | $299",
      "f-heading-1758137935mdwhT-text_html": "You May Also Like",
      "f-buy-buttons-1758137935stWT1-button_label_html": "Add to cart",
      "f-collapsible-tab-1758137935FwZsT-content_html": "<p><strong>Metpure Reverse Osmosis (RO) Faucet </strong>– For fresh, purified water on demand</p>\n<p><br /><strong>Metpure Kitchen Faucet</strong> – Durable design with pullout hose and smooth flow</p>\n<p><br /><strong>Metpure Soap Dispenser</strong> – Sleek, refillable, and matching finish</p>\n<p><br /><strong>4-Stage Metpure Versatile RO System </strong>- Advanced 4-stage purification with easy quick-twist filters with a simple, plumber-free setup.</p>",
      "f-collapsible-tab-1758137935FwZsT-heading_html": "WHAT'S INLCUDED",
      "f-richtext-1758140198CGwwS-text_html": "Harmonized Fixtures & Water Filtration, Designed for Modern Kitchens.",
      "f-heading-1758141888zpOL9-text_html": "Organic foods",
      "f-richtext-1758141888ueBHS-text_html": "<p>Lather up with our newest shampoo for clean, strong, <br />and healthy hair.</p>",
      "f-button-1758141888uHtfi-button_label_html": "Shop collection",
      "f-heading-1758157134wFJLp-text_html": "Choose Your Perfect Match- Different Systems, Same Seamless Style ",
      "f-heading-17581571346nrYf-text_html": "Pure Confidence",
      "f-richtext-1758157134zHIUf-text_html": "Crystal-clear, great-tasting water at your fingertips. The ROGB delivers advanced purification technology in a finish-matched kit that blends effortlessly with your kitchen.",
      "f-button-1758157134NicRS-button_label_html": "Shop now",
      "f-heading-17581571343u8X4-text_html": "Speed Meets Style",
      "f-richtext-1758157134bKkFL-text_html": "Stay hydrated without the wait. The ROLB’s high-flow design delivers fast, reliable access to fresh water all in a sleek, fully coordinated fixture set.",
      "f-button-17581571344CxIO-button_label_html": "Shop now",
      "f-heading-1758157134AbWQ9-text_html": "Balance In Every Sip",
      "f-richtext-1758157134AkqgC-text_html": "Elevate your wellness with pH-balanced, mineral-rich water. The RAGS Alkaline System combines health benefits with seamless design for the modern kitchen.",
      "f-button-1758157134kvuSn-button_label_html": "Shop now",
      "f-heading-1758157117WnaX7-text_html": "A Kit That Brings It All Together",
      "f-richtext-1758157117VdAGA-text_html": "<p>The heart of your home deserves more than mismatched metal. With <em data-start=\"274\" data-end=\"290\">Perfect Match,</em> every fixture flows seamlessly — turning everyday moments into something special.</p>",
      "f-heading-1758157117r8FUC-text_html": "Pure Water",
      "f-richtext-1758157117HZigH-text_html": "<p>A polished, designer look that elevates your entire kitchen</p>",
      "f-heading-17581571179cUAt-text_html": "Seamless Finishes",
      "f-richtext-1758157117JyCS0-text_html": "<p>Easy-to-use fixtures built for daily life, from cooking to clean-up</p>",
